# Getting Started

### Overview

The Trustless Work React SDK exposes typed hooks and a thin client over Core API v2.

{% hint style="info" %}
Write flows typically need an API key (`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_KEY`). Optional wallet-session auth uses `getAccessToken`.
{% endhint %}

### Quick links

